<title>GERMANY: STN Atlas sale talks over, news conference set.</title>
<headline>STN Atlas sale talks over, news conference set.</headline>
<dateline>BREMEN, Germany 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bremen city authorities have called a news conference on Thursday afternoon over talks on selling STN Atlas, the defence electronics unit of bankrupt German shipyard group Bremer Vulkan AG.</p>
<p>A city spokesman said the news conference would take place at 1500 GMT.</p>
<p>Talks on selling STN Atlas, the group's only profitable unit, have narrowed down in recent days to a single bidding group led by Rheinmetall AG and including Badenwerk AG and British Aerospace Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
